 "description": "Juniper MX2010 - the 34RU half-height member of the MX2000 family. Craft interface and EMI cover at the top; an upper cage with a CB-RE at each end and eight Switch Fabric Boards between them; a lower cage of ten vertical MPC slots (LC 0-9, each seated through an adapter card); and at the rear a nine-module PSM wall between the two power distribution modules, with fan trays behind the grilles at both ends.",
 "format": 1,
